{"name":"Dugong","hex":"#71706e","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Dugong","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A taxonomic genus within the family Dugongidae – dugong, a sea mammal."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Dugong"}],"entries":[{"title":"Dugong","blocks":[{"text":"The dugong is a marine mammal. It is one of four living species of the order Sirenia, which also includes three species of manatees. It is the only living representative of the once-diverse family Dugongidae; its closest modern relative, Steller's sea cow, was hunted to extinction in the 18th century."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/42/Dugong.JPG/330px-Dugong.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dugong"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/Dugong-range.png/500px-Dugong-range.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/Dugong-range.png/500px-Dugong-range.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADugong-range.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/Dugong_skeleton_displayed_at_Philippine_National_Museum.jpg/500px-Dugong_skeleton_displayed_at_Philippine_National_Museum.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/Dugong_skeleton_displayed_at_Philippine_National_Museum.jpg/1280px-Dugong_skeleton_displayed_at_Philippine_National_Museum.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/Dugong_skeleton_displayed_at_Philippine_National_Museum.jpg/500px-Dugong_skeleton_displayed_at_Philippine_National_Museum.jp